@App.Backend.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5099

### 1. Dashboard Overview
GET {{App.Backend.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/Dashboard
Accept: application/json

### 2. Client PCs / Industrial Controllers List
GET {{App.Backend.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/ClientPc
Accept: application/json

### 3. Production Machines / Stations List
GET {{App.Backend.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/Machine
Accept: application/json

### 4. Inventory Hardware Components
GET {{App.Backend.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/Inventory/hardware
Accept: application/json

### 5. Inventory Software Components
GET {{App.Backend.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/Inventory/software
Accept: application/json

### 6. Maintenance Tickets
GET {{App.Backend.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/MaintenanceTicket
Accept: application/json

### 7. System Settings Governance
GET {{App.Backend.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/SystemSettings
Accept: application/json
